"""File-extension and web-domain suffix detector (layer-0 MLP unit 5424).

This unit answers to the token that ends a file name or a web address: the `.py` in
`tests/test_merge.py`, the `.js` in `app.js`, the `.com` in `example.com`. Those tokens
push its activation strongly negative, and the size depends on what kind of suffix it is:
a Python file most of all, then other source or config files, then documents, data and
images, then top-level web domains. Every other token gives 0.
"""

